Pizza Legacy v@PROJECT_VERSION@ - Haiku Release
===============================================

@README_INTRO@

RUNNING
-------

Extract the zip, then launch the game with the PizzaLegacy wrapper script:

    ./PizzaLegacy

The wrapper sets LIBRARY_PATH so the bundled libraries are found automatically.
Do not run plegacy.bin directly unless you have all the necessary libraries in
your system path.


