THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
--------------------
This build may include bundled third-party libraries (SDL2, libpng, libADLMIDI).
Their individual licenses are in the LICENSES/ directory.
A summary of all third-party components is in THIRD_PARTIES.txt.


